-- Faction Reactions: destroying a faction's installation may bring its ship.
-- Rewritten from Benson Scripts 34 (Palyar) and 35 (Mechanoid), and their
-- subroutines 461 and 464.

use show from benson

-- Benson's `rand 80` sends a ship for 81 of 256 bytes.
constant odds = 81

on destroyed site by faction where site = "installation"
  ask world to roll 256
  if it > odds then return
  if faction = "palyar" then
    show "PALYAR SHIP ATTACKING" and wait
  else
    show "MECHANOID SHIP ATTACK" and wait
  end if
  ask world to sendAttacker
end destroyed
